            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Here is the current mapping of `;`\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/6630597/aaa821d2-78ef-4fd6-82ea-6416a83a2f12)\r\n\r\nYes, you are right.\r\nAfter disable all Plugins but mini.jumo it is working.\r\n\r\nWhen I activate the LazyVim plugins, the `;` jump is not working anymore\r\n\r\n>     { \"LazyVim/LazyVim\", import = \"lazyvim.plugins\" },\r\n\r\nWhen I only activate LazyVim without the plugins\r\n\r\n>     { \"LazyVim/LazyVim\" },\r\n\r\nit is working.",
